    "role": "Produce Sorter and Team Leader",
    "companyName": "Bushels of Blessing",
    "description": "Bushels of Blessing is a non-profit church-based food collection organization that gleans fresh produce from local farmers and distributes it to food pantries throughout South Jersey as well as parts of Delaware and Pennsylvania. Good relations are maintained between our organization and the farmers that allow us to sort through their produce that does not meet American market standards so that Bushels of Blessing may continue to bring volunteers from the community and schools in to provide fresh food and assistance to those who need it. As team leader, it is my responsibility to verify what produce our group may glean from, organize the volunteers to maximize efficiency, and maintain the highest levels of safety for our group while we're on a farmer's property.In addition to these responsibilities, I share in the workload with the other volunteers and sort produce to take back to our distribution facility.",
